THIRD-PARTY SOFTWARE NOT REDISTRIBUTED
──────────────────────────────────────

  sonar-plugin-api              GNU LGPL 3.0
  https://github.com/SonarSource/sonar-plugin-api

    Compiled against, never shipped. The plugin jar contains no
    org/sonar/api classes; SonarQube supplies them to the plugin
    classloader at runtime. This is the ordinary plugin arrangement
    LGPL §4 contemplates, and creates no obligation on this work.

  clj-kondo                     Eclipse Public License 1.0
  https://github.com/clj-kondo/clj-kondo

    A BUILD-time dependency only. The rule catalogue in
    resources/hbt/sonar/linters.edn is generated from clj-kondo's default
    configuration by `clojure -X:gen-rules`; no clj-kondo code is shipped.
    At analysis time the plugin reads a report clj-kondo produced, and
    invokes nothing.


